{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "cb5ff967b7da47e5e2e437dd5d53ea98373df0558a38c9cedcbfefead54195ed", "ja": "敵か、味方か", "zh": "是敌，还是友", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fecd8e5755bd248746c826df256a0350d435c5316ccef73e768191d75d96ebbf", "ja": "デビューCD発売を控えた3人。いよいよ発売\nイベント当日、集まった観客達が、近くで\n急遽行われた御剣摩耶のイベントに奪われて\nしまう。終了後、社長と話をしている3人の\n前に、当の御剣摩耶が現れる。", "zh": "即将发行出道CD的3人。终于到了发售活动当天，聚集而来的观众却被附近临时举行的御剑摩耶活动吸引了过去。活动结束后，御剑摩耶本人出现在正在和社长交谈的3人面前。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "125c47528e269706785ad70dd066ce504b365d34dce181d21c371b4acadb09f1", "ja": "デビューCD発売を間近に控えた、\nSTAR ELEMENTSの3人は……", "zh": "出道CD发售在即，STAR ELEMENTS的3人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1001_null", "source_sha256": "1a4674cee9a7a61e6ecbe6c82ba28e861e6e6a9a2eb14819757210d9eee1ee74", "ja": "近郊のショップや商店街のミニイベントなどに\n出演、新曲を披露する日々を送っていた。", "zh": "每天都在附近的商店、商店街的小型活动等场合登台，\n为大家献上新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "5a5e2d35dad48fc5edf3b26c2b6389b68a22826afb6b19809fb97fd9542217da", "ja": "地味すぎる……！！！", "zh": "也太朴素了吧……！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "9fa0665466df56ed989ce240fb893464a1b1beb2e8af72ba8682efdbb58be7e6", "ja": "こんなのが、大手事務所のアイドルの仕事！？\n地下アイドルと変わらないじゃない！", "zh": "这种工作，是大事务所偶像的工作！？  \n这和地下偶像有什么区别嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "fe2624495b6352ac31a544fb0d9aed50c75af33244ea32b577d188c4f9e272a7", "ja": "何言ってるの、立派なアイドルの仕事でしょ。\n来月また新曲が出るから、しばらくはこれが続くわ。", "zh": "你在说什么呢，这可是正经偶像的工作吧。\n下个月还会发行新歌，所以接下来一段时间都要继续这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "6dcbd50b064b88bcbdd0293922f035355fdf9a3e16ee0ceb725c43fb47c778b7", "ja": "第一、私たちはこれからデビューする新人なのよ。\n少しは、天羽さんを見習ったら？", "zh": "再说，我们接下来就要出道，是新人啊。\n你多少也该向天羽小姐学习一下吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "275999b4c8d3ad22f47929380c2089186d1c86ac92d88cfc8e9354562195cc95", "ja": "はぁ？　こいつのどこを……。", "zh": "哈？这家伙有什么好学的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "0358b1302978d47e120a2484ffe58b8fa51ed547487d95655e230e9f593f7d38", "ja": "えっへっへ～♪　アイドルのお仕事、楽しいな～♪\n昨日は商店街の人に、お野菜もらっちゃったし♪", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿～♪ 偶像的工作真开心呀～♪\n昨天还从商店街的人那里拿到了蔬菜呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "2a64ca749696a51790a4f454f9758ef80883855c5088ffa97003ad7f56f6e081", "ja": "みんな、「可愛いね」「歌上手だね」って\nいっぱい褒めてくれるし！　それにそれに～……。", "zh": "大家都夸我“好可爱”“歌唱得真好”，\n还夸了我好多好多呢！而且而且～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "f370cf227a006d3c4f16fbf8c3882c8e0f3776a24b0b15da0ea125eed25bc11c", "ja": "こんないい思いばっかりしてて、いいのかな～？\nアイドルって、私の天職なのかも！", "zh": "一直享受着这么多美好的事情，真的没问题吗～？\n偶像说不定就是最适合我的职业！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "31802ad7b7ef101ad70efe0591694ccc84194bfb515f6e1d8689b8f37da38afe", "ja": "……ほんっと、\nお気楽でいいわね、アンタって……。", "zh": "……你这个人，\n还真是乐得清闲啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1013_null", "source_sha256": "80fa99c6dfebc50a7e7fb65f669dca54daed0a4d0e4b95fd8d68dd869043221d", "ja": "STAR ELEMENTSデビュー曲CD\n『Episode. Tiara』発売日、当日……", "zh": "STAR ELEMENTS出道曲CD\n《Episode. Tiara》发售日当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1014_kannkyakua", "source_sha256": "7638b4e22ee9229020af019193325dfdabb38b872293353006380c435c8b686b", "ja": "このSTAR ELEMENTSって、アイドルニュー\nウェーブの受賞者3人組なんだろ？　すごくね？", "zh": "这个STAR ELEMENTS，是由偶像新潮流获奖者3人组成的组合吧？很厉害吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1015_kannkyakub", "source_sha256": "1ebc204f1a71ef8eb86c6d972aa00d79479f69fa7b35a50c366d79584d08dbb2", "ja": "私、気になってたんだよね～。\nチェックしてた人多いんじゃない？", "zh": "我一直很在意这个呢～。\n应该有很多人都在关注吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1016_kannkyakuc", "source_sha256": "2c5a984001054fcd25def9487a63616cf599729cef2d97eaa36555007cf5c89b", "ja": "あ、3人とも結構かわいい……。\n曲聞いていこうかな……。", "zh": "啊，3个人都挺可爱的……。\n要不要听听歌再走呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "d18aba3e70f70a7a6558bedc5bd876704feaeba2fc64515f4ef28aede2fdcca1", "ja": "……良かった。お客さん、結構集まってる。\nCD発売イベント、気合い入れていくわよ。", "zh": "……太好了。观众聚集了不少呢。\nCD发售活动，打起精神来上吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "252e6c35614f9009f6520934b07082d00015f132ae817cdb6e281d5150d0c98e", "ja": "フン。アンタに言われなくたって、\nちゃんとやるに決まってるでしょ。", "zh": "哼。就算你不说，我也肯定会好好表现的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "449c0646166f783b0556cbb147fe8c01e3160fc87a56938b3e4877ef25a9555f", "ja": "うわぁ、いよいよデビューなんだね！\nワクワクするな～……！", "zh": "哇，终于要出道了呢！\n好让人兴奋啊～……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1020_audience", "source_sha256": "fa58af4f0361da4ef749bac0a00d6a1b0f2295a1d5c686590a1d817bd54d2cdc", "ja": "ザワザワ……", "zh": "一阵骚动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1021_tukou", "source_sha256": "4136c4d3274163f7e03871fd65401a3798bc112e4f4e396ad6b617c8a13a84e2", "ja": "おい、大変だ！　向かいのビルのイベントに、\n御剣摩耶が出てるぞ！", "zh": "喂，不好了！御剑摩耶正在对面大楼的活动上登场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1022_kannkyakua", "source_sha256": "7195c4f8e2919e9d1e92466fa5b3d7311a5adde08299e6dfd96b1bdda9f4ef85", "ja": "えっ、摩耶ちゃん！？\n本当！？", "zh": "诶，摩耶！？\n真的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "9d65f6dfdf84c995e28d887bc0bcdc248b4ac7c44b5c8abfb2ba84ef5bb5b7fe", "ja": "！\n御剣摩耶……！", "zh": "！御剑摩耶……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "243ed32698d0adcf4bdce5366496ee7ddc06c6fada26c336632508fb73d89887", "ja": "ええっ！？\nマヤちゃんが、向かいのビルに！？", "zh": "诶！？\n小摩耶在对面的大楼里！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "d495b5f9c451871b19cab849952fc92a176d6a53d41cc146368ba3bd158e6521", "ja": "待って、おかしいわ。今日の私たちの\nデビューイベントは、綿密に計画されたもの……。", "zh": "等等，不对劲。我们今天的\n出道活动，明明是经过周密计划的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1026_017kth", "source_sha256": "160700c8c522ea7f7134379ee4e048fdb0983190800cff4b054cb68a427de9d3", "ja": "近隣で、ましてや御剣摩耶が出演するような\nアイドルイベントなんて、予定にないはず。", "zh": "附近，甚至是有御剑摩耶出演的偶像活动，按理说都没有安排才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "de57bddb0d0f7e45418270ecb569f5fff594f95b6c4654d2d8b4545162730338", "ja": "……私たちを、ジャマしに来たんだわ……。\nそれしか考えられない！　あの女……！", "zh": "……她是来妨碍我们的吧……\n只可能是这样了！那个女人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1028_null", "source_sha256": "494fa7cf2920e00f31d70c39f224838e92e217ce28d6551ddb665731e0695eca", "ja": "イベント終了後……", "zh": "活动结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "faf86ec0c78cf2efcad7f221b766b642a66a581e2cfae68bc82b8766cbe97e8b", "ja": "……。\nお客さん、結構とられちゃったね……。", "zh": "……。\n观众被抢走了不少呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "3fa6f0ab9f2efb0ed7c8df9a57c4fd1a89c8e1758b8436d99e8980c133809947", "ja": "当然でしょ！　新人アイドルのデビューに、\n摩耶のイベントなんて重ねられたら……！", "zh": "这是理所当然的吧！新人偶像的出道，\n要是撞上了摩耶的活动……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1031_017kth", "source_sha256": "ec2d60f6f0f9fef7140541011d9dcb038c07dd022b5d9dd046012ef4349a3819", "ja": "証拠がない以上、現状は邪推でしかないわ。\n……けど、これはあまりにも……。", "zh": "既然没有证据，目前也只能算是无端猜测。……可是，这未免也太……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1032_president", "source_sha256": "405801874ecfe1c2deed72504faae9d3ece4d19185bd988f83678d44fe7bf8fe", "ja": "諸君、お疲れさま！　まずはデビュー曲発売、\nおめでとう。よく頑張ってくれたね！", "zh": "各位，辛苦了！首先，恭喜你们发售了出道曲。\n你们真的很努力啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1033_014mir", "source_sha256": "77229b9c42f4f15df4ab2eb85d5f2151c369723defca98bdc159071736d8c4dc", "ja": "あっ……しゃ、社長！？", "zh": "啊……社、社长！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1034_017kth", "source_sha256": "cbef93a92428122e87c4374d96acb691cce0484199b672db444f5a52fb3ab473", "ja": "お疲れさまです、高林社長。", "zh": "辛苦了，高林社长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1035_president", "source_sha256": "1284b737058ca924f609765544e8765b38330c6c6f0c5805aeca7f56c6fac984", "ja": "客席から見ていたが、近くで、\n何か急なイベントがあったそうだね。", "zh": "我从观众席看了，听说附近\n临时办了什么活动呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1036_president", "source_sha256": "610a89b56710fddb84a8a3d4b17b3355b1f13bf62da8669f6cc98e1ad9f905fc", "ja": "結果、満員とはいかなかったが……しかし、\n見てくれた人々の反応は、決して悪くなかった。", "zh": "结果虽然没能座无虚席……不过，前来看的人们反响绝对算不上差。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1037_president", "source_sha256": "13b0c1d7ed06e89727087ddd92e5eab7f3bc2410906ef281056ca10e3b624e92", "ja": "君達には、それを忘れないでほしい。", "zh": "希望你们不要忘记这一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1038_036kan", "source_sha256": "4b5143925f503d98b62e0a74ff87816131762b8e49e685135dd48b4a5192a0c2", "ja": "あのっ、社長さん！　そのイベント被りの……\n御剣摩耶の件なんですけど！", "zh": "那个，社长！关于活动撞期的……\n御剑摩耶小姐的那件事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1039_201xxx", "source_sha256": "1dc58899a7c98729ffa885feede60024309af411f0ea03bdc43d67dd2dd31376", "ja": "私が、どうかしましたか？", "zh": "我……有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1040_036kan", "source_sha256": "a0f1adb7995fdaa2e2b88fb721f8431b690661cead8535959e005fcb1e24e264", "ja": "っ！！", "zh": "……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1041_014mir", "source_sha256": "381d71336d65fddb80d36593ec2e4c896f71c9434ae3f5ca4c9be21aa96ae548", "ja": "ええっ！？　……ま、マヤちゃん！？\n本物！！？", "zh": "诶！？……玛、玛雅！？\n是真人！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1043_201xxx", "source_sha256": "dc18fdd33e3e13ba68201935f711403e98c1af4baf494cfd37ffa817673d32de", "ja": "初めまして、御剣摩耶です。STAR ELEMENTSの\n皆さん、デビューイベント、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "初次见面，我是御剑摩耶。STAR ELEMENTS的\n各位，出道活动辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1044_201xxx", "source_sha256": "037922fe42464333e431197d1043a8aecdccd0f6bb866938b8337c3eea4095f1", "ja": "同じアイドルニューウェーブ出身だって聞いて、\n気になって……覗きに来ちゃいました。", "zh": "听说你们也是偶像新浪潮出身，\n我有点好奇……就顺道过来看了看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1045_014mir", "source_sha256": "99b333b226ae172a252823ac43301c3b60934e992179735d8a2d1ad11a8454df", "ja": "あ、あの！　私、マヤちゃんに\nすっごく憧れてて……大ファンなんです！", "zh": "啊、那个！我一直非常憧憬麻雅……是她的超级粉丝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1046_201xxx", "source_sha256": "d63fe114e42dc5a972116007016db4214994c9cbd6bbed93c4e2008959005643", "ja": "わぁ、本当に？　ありがとう！\nすっごく嬉しいな。", "zh": "哇，真的吗？谢谢！\n我太开心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1047_201xxx", "source_sha256": "05fbdd9ac18050ed87c99d5196c552d877fdfde721e7b0d999c09b5c8ff2d65c", "ja": "STAR ELEMENTSの皆さんのデビューステージ、\nきっと素敵だったんだろうなぁ……♪", "zh": "STAR ELEMENTS各位的出道舞台，\n一定非常棒吧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1048_201xxx", "source_sha256": "35a5b9f6d6a7f9fd7aa0ae79da130e7299bdb79708eb4addbc02ce0c5aedb1df", "ja": "お仕事がなければ、私も見たかったんですけど……。", "zh": "要是没有工作，我也想去看的，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1049_017kth", "source_sha256": "e111606e5b5914b22051d41693202a289aae6d9feedc9ae2f1b9ecc9648a3801", "ja": "……。\nそれは、どうも。", "zh": "……。\n那真是太可惜了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1051_201xxx", "source_sha256": "cc0e7a8e1315d7a683b81c46eb6d5316c17e0f7d7c2e6ede57426af838da415b", "ja": "でも、皆さんの顔が見られてよかったです！\nそれじゃ、私はこれで。", "zh": "不过，能见到大家的脸，真是太好了！那么，我就先走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1052_014mir", "source_sha256": "3505cf19cd32234325ba47d616de76ec7059516ab31ad0a13954c1204a88b031", "ja": "う、うん！\n来てくれてありがとう！　マヤちゃん！", "zh": "嗯、嗯！\n谢谢你能来！麻耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1053_se", "source_sha256": "ec1af790cbe5a717d390a701e0d39fdb8669efd3b376f0195d6a366da2749d27", "ja": "パタン……", "zh": "磅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1054_014mir", "source_sha256": "163ebfc29f9a2d5e98116fa1dfe94b4c3f55301c467d30125a91e4e0b6a09948", "ja": "もーっ。ふたりとも、なんか感じ悪くない？\nマヤちゃんに失礼だよ！", "zh": "真是的。你们两个，态度是不是有点差呀？\n这样对小玛雅太失礼了啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_02_1055_014mir", "source_sha256": "fff291430476ebdd32bff167218ead30eac8e7fa92f9cdc370f93181b8402fb3", "ja": "あー、本物のマヤちゃん、すっごく可愛かった！\nもっと喋りたかったなー！", "zh": "啊～，小真耶本人真的超级可爱！\n好想再多聊一会儿啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
